  <item>
    <title>EP3: Aube| 西安-香港-深圳| 银行-教育|为什么我享受成为一名教师？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ac2f5a7349f7a5572f9d7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ac2f5a7349f7a5572f9d7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2024 00:59:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我邀请到了我的同学Aube，她从银行业成功转型为深圳的一名教师。我们将深入探讨她的职业转型之路，了解她如何克服挑战，适应新环境，并最终在教育行业中找到自己的热情和定位。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关键词： 职业转型, 教育行业, 深圳教学, 职业发展, 工作与生活平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a></span></strong><span>：开场：评论区解答</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a></span></strong><span>：自我介绍及职业背景</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a></span></strong><span>：银行业的职业经历与转型契机</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a></span></strong><span>：作为班主任的挑战与收获</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a></span></strong><span>：与家长的互动与沟通技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a></span></strong><span>：教学策略与工作量管理</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a></span></strong><span>：公立与私立学校的比较</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>在小宇宙和苹果Podcast App收听完整节目。不要忘记订阅并留下评论哦！</span></p>]]></description>
